<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Wolpert's (1969) linear source-sink diffusion `c_lin(x) = c0*(1 - x/L)` (L110-114), semi-infinite and finite-domain no-flux SDD analytical solutions plus explicit time-dependent SDD PDE relaxation `dc/dt = D d^2c/dx^2 - k c` (L117-189, RMSE = 7.6e-6), Ben-Zvi & Barkai (2010) Expansion-Repression dynamic scaling feedback across growing domains (L214-278), Tickle et al. (1975) ZPA graft superposition and ablation control (L285-351), and Crick (1970) positional noise propagation (L358-386), backed by 5 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_011_french_flag_morphogen.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L691-791) computes 8 reference-anchored quantitative morphometrics: (1) SDD decay length `lambda = 63.2456 um` (`RMSE = 7.6e-6`), (2) Expansion-Repression scaled Blue-zone fraction `0.3333` (`CV = 0.0000` vs unscaled `CV = 0.4567`), (3) wild-type chick wing digit count `3` (`4-3-2`), (4) anterior ZPA graft mirror-duplication digit count `6` (`4-3-2-2-3-4`, reflection asymmetry `0.0`), (5) ZPA ablation negative control digit count `0`, (6) positional boundary error Monte Carlo correlation `r = 0.9990`, (7) specimen radial SDD decay length `37.03 px`, and (8) specimen radial SDD goodness-of-fit `r = 0.9963` (`RMSE = 0.0219`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-expansion-repression-scaled-blue-zone-fraction-across-hh18-hh28-l-180-660-um>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-gallus-gallus-72h-embryo-specimen-radial-sdd-decay-length-lambda-px>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-gallus-gallus-72h-embryo-specimen-radial-sdd-goodness-of-fit-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-positional-boundary-precision-monte-carlo-vs-analytical-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-sdd-characteristic-decay-length-lambda-sqrt-d-k>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-tickle-et-al-1975-anterior-zpa-graft-mirror-duplication-digit-count-4-3-2-2-3-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-tickle-et-al-1975-wild-type-posterior-zpa-chick-wing-digit-count-4-3-2>,
