<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — MorphoEval overall 91.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py` (91.1/100, up from 41.2/100 in Pass 1). The remediated implementation integrates the 1D Synthesis-Diffusion-Degradation (SDD) PDE `dc/dt = D d^2c/dx^2 - k c` (steady-state RMSE = 7.6e-6 vs analytical cosh solution, lambda = 63.2456 um); contrasts Wolpert's (1969) linear source-sink diffusion against unscaled SDD (CV = 0.4567) and Ben-Zvi & Barkai's (2010) Expansion-Repression dynamic scaling (CV = 0.0000, preserving exact 1/3 : 1/3 : 1/3 French-Flag proportions across HH18-HH28 limb growth from 180 to 660 um); reproduces Tickle, Summerbell & Wolpert's (1975) chick wing ZPA graft experiments across 4 regimes (`4-3-2` wild-type, `4-3-2-2-3-4` mirror-image duplication, `4-3-2-3` attenuated graft, and `0`-digit ZPA ablation negative control); validates boundary positional error `sigma_x = (lambda/T_i)*sigma_c` via Monte Carlo ensemble (`r = 0.9990`); and segments the SHA-256-locked 72h HH18-20 `Gallus gallus` embryo photograph (`r = 0.9963`, RMSE = 0.0219). Overall 91.1/100 (faithfulness 90.6, reproducibility 92.2); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/french_flag_morphogen_comparison.png: rendered output of 1969-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen.py at b9976f8, image/png, 1006934 B, 2880×1792 px, artifact_sha256 672a47196c76f705489d6663b7854c345234f2bc41470fbf74c72f65c28c8b6d (sha256 672a47196c76f705489d6663b7854c345234f2bc41470fbf74c72f65c28c8b6d), spec_fingerprint 8c772d71b75bec8f158cb37c09ad0b582febd6312d060c187ac44cf5cbb1bf84. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 8c772d71b75bec8f158cb37c09ad0b582febd6312d060c187ac44cf5cbb1bf84; artifact_sha256: 672a47196c76f705489d6663b7854c345234f2bc41470fbf74c72f65c28c8b6d; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/french_flag_morphogen/french_flag_morphogen_reference.json=deae09091fa98a1b..., datasets/french_flag_morphogen/french_flag_specimen.jpg=7163e90c56e1316e..., datasets/french_flag_morphogen/scout_manifest.json=d3bd7cc1c62dd2cb...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-french-flag-morphogen-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 1D anteroposterior chick limb ZPA solver to a 2D proximo-distal × anteroposterior paddle mesh coupling apical ectodermal ridge (AER) FGF8 outgrowth with posterior ZPA Shh diffusion." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.11e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication & Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling — Parameter expressivity: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
